The Iprenron are an elite military force in the Viaan Kingdoms. It was the elite force in the Pre-Dawn era and has remained as several faction in several nations.

They follow the Qui Iure Belli laws as laid out by [[aenar|Aenar]] They fight without any swords or other martial weapons. They use their giant strength to kill their foe with giant chains attached to their gauntlets.
